Program1: Write a program to swap values of two user given positive integer

SourceCode: 
#include <stdio.h>

int main()
{
    int a, b;

    printf("Enter first number: ");
    scanf("%d", &a);

    printf("Enter second number: ");
    scanf("%d", &b);

    a = a + b;
    b = a - b;
    a = a - b;

    printf("After swapping:\n");
    printf("First number = %d\n", a);
    printf("Second number = %d\n", b);

